AB  - Breast Cancer continues to challenge the medical futurity globally. Death rate of breast cancer can be reduced by making awareness about breast cancer categories, their symptoms, evaluation methods with their cost and timely detection policies. Appropriate monitoring contributes best treatment which incredibly leads to survival of BC patients. Globally Automatic detection of BC system allows doctors to make more reliable decision. Recently, BC image classification involved into data acquisition, segmentation, feature selection and classification using DL algorithms demonstrated the most reliable solution. The classification evaluation is performed by using some evaluation Matrix. The broad review aims to present an outline of breast cancer diverse categories, advanced analysis and detection techniques.With emerging technologies like molecular imaging and liquid biopsies early detection and monitoring become possible. Breast histopathology image gives Clear idea about image analysis used in identification of tumor malignancies. Manual examination is subjective, time-consuming and huge chances of misclassification. Recent diagnosis tools in medical image analysis play vital role in decision making.  © 2024 IEEE.
