TI  - Nonalbuminuric Diabetic Kidney Disease and Risk of All-Cause Mortality and Cardiovascular and Kidney Outcomes in Type 2 Diabetes: Findings From the Hong Kong Diabetes Biobank
PY  - 2022
T2  - American Journal of Kidney Diseases
VL  - 80
IS  - 2
SP  - 196
EP  - 206.e1
