TI  - Neonatal multiorgan failure due to ACAD9 mutation and complex i deficiency with mitochondrial hyperplasia in liver, cardiac myocytes, skeletal muscle, and renal tubules
PY  - 2016
T2  - Human Pathology
VL  - 49
SP  - 27
EP  - 32
