TI  - Potential misclassification of alcohol intoxication as cardiovascular deaths in Yakutsk in 2007-2018: A forensic autopsy data-based study
PY  - 2019
T2  - Ekologiya Cheloveka (Human Ecology)
VL  - 2019
IS  - 10
SP  - 59
EP  - 64
DO  - 10.33396/1728-0869-2019-10-59-64
