TI  - Minoca in Iceland. Acute coronary syndrome in patients with normal or nonobstructive coronary arteries
ST  - Brátt kransædaheilkenni hjá sjúklingum med edlilegar eda nær edlilegar kransædar
PY  - 2018
T2  - Laeknabladid
VL  - 104
IS  - 5
