TI  - Uncovering a missing demographic in trauma registries: Epidemiology of trauma among American Indians and Alaska Natives in Washington State
PY  - 2015
T2  - Injury Prevention
VL  - 21
IS  - 5
SP  - 335
EP  - 343
DO  - 10.1136/injuryprev-2014-041419
